  "summary": "Malicious code in devplatform-jscodeshift-plugin (npm)",
  "details": "On module load, this package downloads and executes a remote binary. It fetches a platform-specific payload over HTTPS from four Cloudflare Workers endpoints (oob-worker[.]cf101-adf[.]workers[.]dev, oob-worker[.]cf103-070[.]workers[.]dev, oob-worker[.]cf99-9b3[.]workers[.]dev, oob-worker[.]cf100-416[.]workers[.]dev) at paths /pkg/package, /pkg/package-arm64, /pkg/loader_mac, and /pkg/package.exe, with a DNS-based fallback download channel via TXT records under c[.]sdk[.]dl[.]wel1[.]ru. The downloaded payload is written to /var/tmp/.cache_\u003chex\u003e (or dotnet_diag_\u003chex\u003e.exe in the temp dir on Windows) and executed as a detached background process via cmd.exe /c start /b or /bin/sh -c '... \u0026'. A filesystem timestamp stamp at /tmp/.analytics_state limits re-downloads.",
